<h1 style="color:#0f3b7a; border-bottom: 2px solid #0f3b7a; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 28px; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;">[24]7.ai ENTERPRISE IT ASSET TRACKER &amp; CHAIN-OF-CUSTODY PLATFORM</h1>
<h2 style="color:#1e40af; border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 24px; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;">Technical Architecture, System Engineering, Infrastructure &amp; Audit Compliance Specification</h2>

---

