<h2 style="color:#1e40af; border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 4px; margin-top: 24px; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;">4. Node.js Backend Integration &amp; API Services</h2>

The backend runs as a high-throughput Express.js service on port 3000, encapsulated in <code style="background-color:#f1f5f9; padding:2px 4px; font-family:Consolas, Courier New, monospace; font-size:10pt; border-radius:3px;">dist/server.cjs</code>.

<h3 style="color:#1e293b; margin-top: 18px; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;">4.1 Core REST API Endpoints</h3>

<table style="border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; margin:16px 0; font-size:10pt; font-family:Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;">
  <tr style="background-color:#0f3b7a; color:#ffffff;">
    <th style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px; text-align:left;">Method</th>
    <th style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px; text-align:left;">Endpoint</th>
    <th style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px; text-align:left;">Description</th>
    <th style="border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:8px; text-align:left;">Role Authorization</th>
  </tr>
